        <mxCell id="c100" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Reconciliations, the lower part, the billing table filtered to the window&#x27;s 3 years. The Findings table lists its rows by its first column, as a table without a sort of its own does, and its full text is in the table of Step 6. The roll-forward matrix, the cards, the sales tax matrix and the page&#x27;s text box are not drawn.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="450" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
